<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"The skin...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I froze with the glass of tomato juice I'd been about to drink.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="は">flayed</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> body? The whole body, at that?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right. It's no figure of speech. I believe the victim was literally dying, skin </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="は">peeled</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey now... that's way beyond bad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face twitched.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Apparently she hadn't expected anything this gruesome.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I also examined other angles, like burning to death, or dissolution by acid, but in the end I think this is the most likely. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It's a way of killing every bit as cruel as the past Megasawa City case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">After all, it means having the skin of your whole body gouged off with a blade while you're alive, while you're conscious."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Whoa... I've heard of dismembered bodies and awful lynching incidents, but the whole body flayed..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"As if to back that up, the witnesses all said the same thing."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
